{"id":"n41163-1-9","stage":0,"title":"냄비 · 小锅","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41163-1-9-1","ko":"승규야, 냄비를 써야 하니 설거지 좀 하거라.","zh":"承奎啊，得用锅了，快去洗一下碗吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}},{"text":"냄비를","meaning":"小锅，汤锅，铝锅","explanation":"냄비：小锅，汤锅，铝锅；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"냄비","audio":"/audio/61c1473461c3ddf8ec3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41163","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냄비를","audio":"/audio/825364cfbdc9c212ab83.mp3"}},{"text":"써야","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"써야","audio":"/audio/3eeba0baa1ae7cce1a5b.mp3"}},{"text":"하니","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하니","audio":"/audio/917bc632330b55c71985.mp3"}},{"text":"설거지","meaning":"刷碗，洗碗","explanation":"설거지：刷碗，洗碗","readings":[{"term":"설거지","audio":"/audio/43618b069071a4b4692e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62246","senseId":"1","lemma":"설거지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설거지","audio":"/audio/43618b069071a4b4692e.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReadin